  ~
  ~ Resources lint reports as unused but which are referenced where lint does not look:
  ~ faded_primary is used by the v29 light theme, which the E Ink theme's resources still pull in.
  ~ Keeps them out of the unused-resource prune (tools/mmd prune scripts use lint's report).
  -->
